062257   *"8RFAC
"062257   %========================================================================
062257   %      T O F E N T R Y
062257   %
062257   % SUBROUTINE TO SET PIT 0 BEFORE CALLING THE FILE-USER SEGMENT
062257   % AND TO RESET TO PIT 3 BEFORE RETURNING TO PT3FUSER
062257   %
