065275   % 33.25      S E T C L O C K
065275   %
065275   %  ROUTINE TO UPDATE PANEL CLOCK ON N-100.  THE CLOCK IS UPDATED
065275   %  WITH THE COMMAND @UPDAT OR THE SIMILAR MONITOR CALL (MON 111)
065275   %  AND THE COMMAND @CLADJ OR THE SIMILAR MONITOR CALL (MON 112)
065275   %
065275   % CALLED WITH MONITOR LEVEL DISABLED!!!!
065275   %
065275   
065275   SUBR SETCLOCK
