126707          CALL IONIOF           % IN RESIDENT (WITH PAGING ON)
126710          X:=1; CALL IOTRANS; GO GORET; A\/CCHAR; *IRW ALEVB DA;
126715          CALL IONIOF
126716          X+1; CALL IOTRANS; GO GORET; A SHZ 10=:CCHAR; *IRW ALEVB DD;
126724          CALL IONIOF
