126747          CALL IONIOF
126750          X+1; CALL IOTRANS; GO GORET; A SHZ 10=:CCHAR; *IRW ALEVB DX;
126756          CALL IONIOF
126757          X+1; CALL IOTRANS; GO GORET; A\/CCHAR; *IRW ALEVB DX;
126764          CALL IONIOF
126765          X+1
126766   GORET: A:=X; *IRW ALEVB DT
126770          GO MOURET
